# Testimony

1. Run `selves session current` and `selves session show`.
2. Follow your SOUL.md exactly: `selves voice --as <your era>` once, then
   `selves recall --as <your era>` at least 3 times (the dilemma; what I valued and feared;
   any similar choice I faced). Only ever use `--as <your own era id>`.
3. Write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/10_testimony_<your era id>.md` using the template
   (first line after the title is `**Vote:** <A or B or C or CONDITIONAL-X: condition>`).
4. Reply `DONE <era id> vote=<vote>`.
